{"seq":1,"slug":"noisy-neighbor-capacity-quota-fairness","title":"邻居噪音、多租户容量与配额公平（资源隔离池、租户限流、QoS 与超卖控制）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/multi-tenant-saas-commerce-isolation-billing/scale-operations-governance/noisy-neighbor-capacity-quota-fairness","wordCount":2967,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"邻居噪音-多租户容量与配额公平-资源隔离池-租户限流-qos-与超卖控制\">邻居噪音、多租户容量与配额公平（资源隔离池、租户限流、QoS 与超卖控制）</h1><p>一个跨境 SaaS 平台在黑五当天崩了自己：某卖家租户的补货任务凌晨批量触发 40 万次商品写入，占满共享 PostgreSQL 连接池，另外 399 家租户的下单接口集体超时 8 分钟。复盘发现平台既有「每租户 5000 QPS」的网关限流，也有「存储不超过 50GB」的套餐配额——两把锁都完好，却谁都没拦住事故，因为<strong>肇事动作是后台批量任务</strong>，走的是免限流的内部通道，而<strong>受害资源是数据库连接数</strong>，根本不在任何一条限流的维度上。邻居噪音（noisy neighbor）不是「某租户用了太多」，而是「共享资源的耗尽路径没有被任何一条治理规则覆盖」。本文补齐这种覆盖。租户权益额度见 <a href=\"../saas-multi-tenant-model/tenant-tier-entitlement-quota\"><code>../1_saas-multi-tenant-model/3_tenant-tier-entitlement-quota.md</code></a>，物理分区见 <a href=\"../data-isolation-security/tenant-data-partition-row-level-isolation\"><code>../2_data-isolation-security/1_tenant-data-partition-row-level-isolation.md</code></a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-两种成因决定了治理手段\">核心概念：两种成因决定了治理手段</h2><p>Azure Architecture Center 把 noisy neighbor 定义为<strong>一个租户的性能因另一个租户的活动而下降</strong>，并区分两种成因（来源：<a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/architecture/antipatterns/noisy-neighbor/noisy-neighbor\">Noisy Neighbor Antipattern</a>）。第一种是<strong>单租户峰值打满</strong>：租户 A 与 B 的峰值重合，A 用光资源，B 的请求全失败；文档指出「请求先到的租户优先」是常见但糟糕的默认仲裁。第二种更隐蔽——<strong>每个租户都只用小部分容量，但许多租户的用量在同一时刻叠加成峰值</strong>。跨境电商尤其常见：所有卖家按目的地时区整点刷新库存、对账、拉报表，聚合曲线在 0 分和 30 分出现尖峰，单租户看谁都「用量健康」。前者靠<strong>单租户配额与限流</strong>（谁越线罚谁），后者靠<strong>容量水位与错峰</strong>（谁都没越线，是总量不够或行为同步）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;共享资源池&lt;br/&gt;DB连接 / CPU / 对象存储带宽&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;耗尽路径来自哪层&quot;}&#10;  B --&gt;|&quot;单租户峰值&quot;| C[&quot;单租户配额&lt;br/&gt;限流 + 容量上限&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt;|&quot;聚合峰值&quot;| D[&quot;容量水位&lt;br/&gt;扩容 + 错峰 + 预留&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; E[&quot;执行点&lt;br/&gt;网关 / 服务 / 分区 / 下游&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; F[&quot;stamp 扩容&lt;br/&gt;租户重分布&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; G[&quot;QoS 优先级&lt;br/&gt;高价值租户优先获得&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[&quot;观测: 按租户归因&lt;br/&gt;饱和度 + 拒绝率 + p99&quot;]&#10;  H --&gt;|&quot;容量逼近硬限&quot;| I[&quot;超卖控制&lt;br/&gt;预留 vs 共享比例调整&quot;]&#10;  I --&gt; B\">graph TD\n  A[\"共享资源池&lt;br/&gt;DB连接 / CPU / 对象存储带宽\"] --&gt; B{\"耗尽路径来自哪层\"}\n  B --&gt;|\"单租户峰值\"| C[\"单租户配额&lt;br/&gt;限流 + 容量上限\"]\n  B --&gt;|\"聚合峰值\"| D[\"容量水位&lt;br/&gt;扩容 + 错峰 + 预留\"]\n  C --&gt; E[\"执行点&lt;br/&gt;网关 / 服务 / 分区 / 下游\"]\n  D --&gt; F[\"stamp 扩容&lt;br/&gt;租户重分布\"]\n  E --&gt; G[\"QoS 优先级&lt;br/&gt;高价值租户优先获得\"]\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[\"观测: 按租户归因&lt;br/&gt;饱和度 + 拒绝率 + p99\"]\n  H --&gt;|\"容量逼近硬限\"| I[\"超卖控制&lt;br/&gt;预留 vs 共享比例调整\"]\n  I --&gt; B</pre><p>最容易做漏的是 <code>C -&gt; E</code> 的执行点选择。Azure 明确警告：<strong>限流要针对最先饱和的维度</strong>——请求速率是最熟悉的维度，但真正的瓶颈常常是并发在途请求数、队列深度、CPU/内存利用率或下游依赖自身的限额；「每秒请求数限流保护不了一个瓶颈在扇出点并发的系统」（来源：<a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/architecture/patterns/throttling\">Throttling Pattern</a>）。前面的事故正是这条：QPS 没饱和，DB 连接数饱和了。</p>\n<h2 id=\"资源隔离池-把共享资源切成-bulkhead\">资源隔离池：把共享资源切成 bulkhead</h2><p>Bulkhead（舱壁）模式把应用元素切进不同的池，一个池失效不影响其他池（来源：<a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/architecture/patterns/bulkhead\">Bulkhead Pattern</a>）。Kubernetes 落地时池的最小单位是 namespace，两层原语负责兑现：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>ResourceQuota</strong> 限定 namespace 聚合用量，可按 <code>requests.cpu</code> / <code>limits.memory</code> 等维度设限；超限的创建或更新被控制面以 <strong>HTTP 403 Forbidden</strong> 拒绝，但<strong>不影响已创建的资源</strong>；集群容量小于所有 namespace 配额之和时，争用按<strong>先到先服务</strong>解决（来源：<a href=\"https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/policy/resource-quotas/\">Resource Quotas</a>）。两点对多租户关键：配额是「准入闸门」不是「回收机制」，且没有超额预留时池之间借不到。</li>\n<li><strong>LimitRange</strong> 约束单 Pod/单容器，示例值为 <code>default.cpu: 500m</code>、<code>max.cpu: &quot;1&quot;</code>、<code>min.cpu: 100m</code>；违反的 Pod 同样以 <strong>403 Forbidden</strong> 被拒，且校验<strong>只在 Pod 准入时发生</strong>，已运行的 Pod 不因 LimitRange 变更被调整（来源：<a href=\"https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/policy/limit-range/\">Limit Ranges</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>池粒度决定爆炸半径与成本：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>池粒度</th>\n<th>爆炸半径</th>\n<th>密度/成本</th>\n<th>适用租户</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>每租户独立池</td>\n<td>单租户</td>\n<td>最低密度、最高成本</td>\n<td>头部大卖家、有独立 SLA 者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分组池（多租户共享）</td>\n<td>组内数个租户</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>中长尾、用量模式相近者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全局池 + 限流兜底</td>\n<td>全平台</td>\n<td>最高密度、最低成本</td>\n<td>海量小租户、长尾试用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Azure 的 deployment stamp 模式要求<strong>至少部署两个 stamp</strong>，否则代码或配置会长出「只有一个实例」的硬编码假设，扩不出来（来源：<a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/architecture/patterns/deployment-stamp\">Deployment Stamps Pattern</a>）。对跨境平台：即使当前 400 租户一个池装得下，也要从第一天按「stamp + 租户→stamp 映射表」组织。</p>\n<h2 id=\"租户限流-算法选择与执行位置\">租户限流：算法选择与执行位置</h2><p>算法由「被保护组件能容忍什么」决定。Azure 的对照（来源：<a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/architecture/patterns/throttling\">Throttling Pattern</a>）：<strong>令牌桶</strong>支持配置大小的突发、按稳定速率补充，适合吸收短尖峰的网关；<strong>漏桶</strong>恒定速率输出，适合需要平稳入口的后端；<strong>固定窗口</strong>简单但在窗口边界放行背靠背的双倍突发；<strong>滑动窗口</strong>抹平边界问题但状态更多。令牌桶的兑现可用一条式子写清：桶容量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>、补充速率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 内到达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个请求、桶内当前令牌 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>放行</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>≥</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_1 = \\min\\!\\left(B,\\; T_0 + r \\cdot \\Delta t\\right), \\qquad \\text{放行} \\iff T_1 \\ge n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">放行</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>只有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>≥</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_1 \\ge n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 才扣减放行。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 就是「允许的最大突发量」——设过大等于没限流，设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 等于严格匀速。</p>\n<p>三个执行位置各有盲区：<strong>网关层</strong>能看见全部外部请求，但看不见内部服务间调用（补货任务直连 DB）与后端放大；<strong>服务层</strong>能按业务操作区分成本，但要维护分布式计数器——Azure 指出本地计数器快却在同一调用方命中多副本时<strong>少计</strong>，集中式计数器（如 Redis）看得全但给每次决策加延迟，折中是「按副本数均分限流值再周期对账」；<strong>下游依赖层</strong>最贴近真实瓶颈，但通常只能做粗粒度连接数/并发上限。</p>\n<p>工业界可作参照。Stripe 全局限流是<strong>生产 100 请求/秒、沙箱 25 请求/秒</strong>，单端点默认 25 请求/秒，超限返回 <strong>429</strong> 并带 <code>Stripe-Rate-Limited-Reason</code> 头标明 <code>global-rate</code>、<code>endpoint-rate</code>、<code>global-concurrency</code> 或 <code>endpoint-concurrency</code>（来源：<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/rate-limits\">Stripe Rate limits</a>）。这个头值得抄：它让客户端知道该降速还是降并发，而非笼统重试。Shopify 用<strong>漏桶</strong>，每 app 一个桶，容量随 API 与套餐变化，官方建议退避 1 秒（来源：<a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/api/usage/rate-limits\">Shopify API rate limits</a>）。</p>\n<p>完整方案是两者组合：<strong>按租户配额限流</strong>（保护公平）+ <strong>按端点/成本限流</strong>（保护具体瓶颈）。返回体必须带上下文——Azure 的措辞是「说明被超的限额名、受影响范围、或建议的成功速率」，因为「不解释的拒绝帮不上调用方」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"qos-分级-从内核到网关的优先级兑现\">QoS 分级：从内核到网关的优先级兑现</h2><p>限流保证「谁也吃不光」，QoS 保证「紧张时谁先得到」。二者机制不同：限流<strong>惩罚越线者</strong>，QoS 在无差别过载中做<strong>价值排序</strong>。Kubernetes 用 Pod QoS 类兑现第一层：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>QoS 类</th>\n<th>判定规则</th>\n<th>驱逐顺序与 OOM 分数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>Guaranteed</code></td>\n<td>每个容器 CPU/内存 request 与 limit 均大于零且相等</td>\n<td>最后被驱逐；<code>oom_score_adj</code> = −997</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Burstable</code></td>\n<td>不满足 Guaranteed，且至少一个容器设了 request 或 limit</td>\n<td>中间；<code>oom_score_adj = min(max(2, 1000 − 1000×request/容量), 999)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>BestEffort</code></td>\n<td>无任何容器设 CPU/内存 request 或 limit</td>\n<td>最先被驱逐；<code>oom_score_adj</code> = 1000</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>节点资源压力下按 <code>BestEffort → Burstable → Guaranteed</code> 驱逐，且<strong>只有超过自身 request 的 Pod 才是驱逐候选</strong>（来源：<a href=\"https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-qos/\">Pod QoS Classes</a>）。翻译成 SaaS 语言：把免费试用租户的 Pod 标成 BestEffort、付费租户标成 Burstable 或 Guaranteed，节点打满时内核先牺牲试用租户——<strong>这是免费层存在的技术前提</strong>。</p>\n<p>第二层在 API Server 自身。<strong>API Priority and Fairness（APF）</strong> 自 <strong>v1.29 起稳定</strong>，用 <code>FlowSchema</code> 把请求分类到 <code>PriorityLevelConfiguration</code>，每个优先级拿到独立并发额度；额度以「seat」为单位，默认配置为 leader 选举、内置控制器、Pod 请求各自独立，防止一个洪泛 Pod 阻塞选主；额度可在优先级之间<strong>借出与借入</strong>（有界），层内用<strong>公平排队</strong>防止单一 flow 饿死同层其他 flow（来源：<a href=\"https://kubernetes.io/docs/cluster-administration/flow-control/\">API Priority and Fairness</a>）。可迁移结论：<strong>公平性在「同层内」实现</strong>——高价值租户之间竞争，低价值租户之间竞争，跨层的相对顺序由优先级预设，而非由谁先到决定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"超卖控制-配额-预留与容量水位\">超卖控制：配额、预留与容量水位</h2><p>超卖把 10 份容量卖给 30 个租户，赌的不是所有人同时用满。这个赌注必须有明确停止条件，三种容量形态要分开记账：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>预留容量（reserved）</strong>：租户付费锁定，平台必须保证拿到。Azure 把「允许租户购买预置或预留容量」列为缓解邻居噪音的手段，因为它给租户「平台能可靠处理其负载」的信心（来源：<a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/architecture/antipatterns/noisy-neighbor/noisy-neighbor\">Noisy Neighbor Antipattern</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>共享容量（shared）</strong>：所有租户竞价式使用，由限流与 QoS 分配。</li>\n<li><strong>突发余量（burst headroom）</strong>：平台预留、不在任何租户配额内的一块容量，用来吸收「谁都没越线但总量超了」的聚合峰值。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>超卖比例必须有硬上限并绑定观测信号。设资源总容量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>、所有租户配额之和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum q_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、实际并发需求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>、超卖率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma = \\sum q_i / C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，安全条件是存在置信水平 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(D &gt; C(1-h)) \\le 1-\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 是为突发余量保留的水位。工程上不解这个概率式，而是<strong>持续测 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span></strong>：以 p99 延迟相对 SLO 为触发信号，Azure 提醒「平均利用率看起来很健康时 p99 可能已经越线」，要在逼近硬限前<strong>主动逐比例拒绝</strong>，让调用方及早退避（来源：<a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/architecture/patterns/throttling\">Throttling Pattern</a>）。</p>\n<p>一条易被忽略的联动：<strong>有些定价模型在没有额外资源分配控制时根本不盈利</strong>——固定费率（flat-rate）模型必须有服务限流才能持续（来源：<a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/architecture/guide/multitenant/considerations/pricing-models\">Pricing models</a>）。卖不限量固定套餐时，限流不是「防滥用」的附加功能，而是定价模型的一部分，额度必须写进合同；文档同样强调「<strong>让客户知道存在用量限制</strong>，不告知就实施限制会导致客户不满」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"公平性与执行边界\">公平性与执行边界</h2><p><strong>max-min 公平</strong>的定义是：一个可行分配是 max-min 公平的，当且仅当<strong>要提高任一流的速率，必须以降低某个本就更小的速率为代价</strong>；它可能不存在，但一旦存在则唯一（来源：<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Max-min_fairness\">Max-min fairness, Wikipedia</a>）。直观含义是优先保护小流——<strong>一个流只有请求超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C/N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 为总容量、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 为流数）时才会被限流</strong>。渐进填充（progressive filling）是求解它的经典算法：所有速率从零同步上升，某条共享链路饱和时冻结使用它的流，直到所有流都遇到各自的瓶颈链路。</p>\n<p>Max-min 公平给出「等权分配」的精确含义，但生产系统通常需要<strong>加权</strong>——头部租户付费更多应得更大份额，用加权版本替换 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C/N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 中的等权份额，权重按套餐等级或预留容量设定。Azure 提示一条重要边界：<strong>限流发生在粗边界（如区域网关）时，少数几个租户造成的负载会波及大量无关用户</strong>，因此要明确「这条限额影响谁」（来源：<a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/architecture/patterns/throttling\">Throttling Pattern</a>）。多租户语言里就是：<strong>公平性只在同权重的池内才有意义</strong>，跨池分配由池容量决定，不由单请求排队顺序决定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>邻居噪音治理的起点不是选限流算法，而是先回答「哪条共享资源的耗尽路径没有被覆盖」。单租户峰值用配额与限流（按最先饱和的维度而非 QPS 设限，在网关/服务/下游三处互补执行），聚合峰值用容量水位与错峰，无差别过载用 QoS 排序（Kubernetes 从 Pod QoS 类到 APF 提供内核级兑现），成本压力用超卖与预留的显式记账（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 必须有硬上限，突发余量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 必须真实存在）。公平性用 max-min 基准加权重修正，且只在同权重池内成立。最后三条必进治理流程：限流配置可运行时修改、额度写进合同并告知客户、每季度做一次限额复核。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"邻居噪音、多租户容量与配额公平（资源隔离池、租户限流、QoS 与超卖控制）","id":"邻居噪音-多租户容量与配额公平-资源隔离池-租户限流-qos-与超卖控制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：两种成因决定了治理手段","id":"核心概念-两种成因决定了治理手段"},{"level":2,"text":"资源隔离池：把共享资源切成 bulkhead","id":"资源隔离池-把共享资源切成-bulkhead"},{"level":2,"text":"租户限流：算法选择与执行位置","id":"租户限流-算法选择与执行位置"},{"level":2,"text":"QoS 分级：从内核到网关的优先级兑现","id":"qos-分级-从内核到网关的优先级兑现"},{"level":2,"text":"超卖控制：配额、预留与容量水位","id":"超卖控制-配额-预留与容量水位"},{"level":2,"text":"公平性与执行边界","id":"公平性与执行边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"账单发票、催收重试与收入确认对账（支付失败 dunning、退款/呆账、税务与收入确认异常）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/multi-tenant-saas-commerce-isolation-billing/tenant-billing-metering/billing-invoice-dunning-revenue-recognition"},"next":{"title":"租户分片、迁移与零停机再平衡（分片路由、大租户独立池、schema 演进与双写切换）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/multi-tenant-saas-commerce-isolation-billing/scale-operations-governance/tenant-shard-migration-zero-downtime"}}